Do not introduce colors outside these tokens (photography excepted).

# 4. GLOBAL BEHAVIOUR
- html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 88px } ; overflow-x: clip on body. No horizontal scroll at any width from 360px to 1600px.
- All images: explicit width/height (or aspect-ratio box) to prevent layout shift; `object-fit: cover`; `decoding="async"`; below-the-fold images `loading="lazy"`; hero background image `fetchpriority="high"`, `loading="eager"`.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion: disable floats, reveals, parallax-like transitions; content must be fully visible without JS animation.
- Visible :focus-visible ring on every interactive element: 2px solid var(--ink), offset 3px.
- A "Skip to content" link as the first focusable element.

